After saving, Home Assistant starts the receiver, saves recovery settings, sets channel B and restarts the Wi-Fi module. Setup status shows the result and waits for live measurements. Channel A remains connected to the cloud.

The suggested Home Assistant address is {receiver_ip}:{port}. Change it only if your network requires this.
